+- Project and Lokasi Proyek are identity boundaries; village and visual proximity are not.
+- One host edge supplies one effective `Jarak (m)` to both JTM and Underbuild.
+- Existing SUTM stays red solid and Existing SUTR stays blue solid.
+- Apply and delete mutations are transactional and idempotent.
